{"title":"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff9d2add1273f7f294d4f0318b0ed4340c07768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> and distinct points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> on line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff9d2add1273f7f294d4f0318b0ed4340c07768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" />, draw lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970a3f7a0a3b548d0684d391994a6366f8d71ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/7/587edad44bc07186584e2522b8fe2769515b4065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> through point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, with angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" /> as marked in the figure. Also, draw line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> at an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> from line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff9d2add1273f7f294d4f0318b0ed4340c07768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> such that it intersects line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970a3f7a0a3b548d0684d391994a6366f8d71ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Establish necessary and sufficient conditions on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" /> , and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> such that a triangle can be drawn with one of its sides as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> with lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff9d2add1273f7f294d4f0318b0ed4340c07768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970a3f7a0a3b548d0684d391994a6366f8d71ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/7/587edad44bc07186584e2522b8fe2769515b4065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> as the angle bisectors of that triangle.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e797a0b083710b51f141ae818ad1ea7a15c0d6b0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] D((-2,-2)--(2,2),black+linewidth(.75)); D((-1,2)--(1,-2),black+linewidth(.75)); D((-2,1)--(2,-1),black+linewidth(.75)); D((-.7,1.4)--(-1.3,-1.3),black+linewidth(.75)); MP(&quot;\\ell_1&quot;,(1.5,1.6),N); MP(&quot;\\ell_2&quot;,(-1.1,1.5),N); MP(&quot;\\ell_3&quot;,(-1.5,.3),N); MP(&quot;\\alpha&quot;,(.05,.2),N); MP(&quot;\\beta&quot;,(-.35,.13),N); MP(&quot;\\gamma&quot;,(-1.1,-1.1),N); MP(&quot;Y&quot;,(-.7,1.4),NE); MP(&quot;X&quot;,(-1.3,-1.3),S); MP(&quot;I&quot;,(-.1,-.1),S); dot((-1.3,-1.3));dot((-.7,1.4));dot((0,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO\" title=\"2013 UMO\">2013 UMO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 UMO Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.utmath.org/home\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 UMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Utah_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"Utah Math Olymp